	"name": "Hognose Flop",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/death/hand-dirt-undead-zombie.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 14th level, you have learned that not everyone double-taps downed opponents. Once per long rest, when you would be reduced to 0 HP, you can instead drop to 1 HP and feign death with a deception or performance check against your enemy’s passive insight. On a success, they assume you are dead until you move, take an action, or talk.</p><p>If a creature attacks you while you are in the hognose flop, you can use your reaction to make an attack with a firearm which has advantage, ignoring disadvantage from being within 5ft of an enemy. On a hit, you deal damage as though you landed a critical hit. On a critical hit, your target also cannot make attacks until the start of their next turn.</p>",
